<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Thì Hiện Tại Tiếp Diễn</title>

<style>
body{
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
max-width:1000px;
margin:auto;
padding:20px;
background:#f5f7fa;
line-height:1.6;
}

.card{
background:white;
padding:20px;
margin-bottom:20px;
border-radius:10px;
box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1);
}

h1{
color:#1976d2;
}

button{
background:#1976d2;
color:white;
border:none;
padding:10px 20px;
border-radius:5px;
cursor:pointer;
}

.result{
font-size:20px;
font-weight:bold;
margin-top:20px;
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="card">

<h1>
THÌ HIỆN TẠI TIẾP DIỄN
(PRESENT CONTINUOUS)
</h1>

<h2>1. Cách dùng</h2>

<h3>1. Hành động đang xảy ra tại thời điểm nói</h3>

<ul>
<li>She is studying now.</li>
<li>They are playing football.</li>
</ul>

<h3>2. Hành động đang diễn ra trong giai đoạn hiện tại</h3>

<ul>
<li>I am learning English this month.</li>
<li>My brother is working in Hanoi this year.</li>
</ul>

<h3>3. Kế hoạch trong tương lai gần</h3>

<ul>
<li>We are visiting Ha Long Bay next week.</li>
</ul>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>2. Công thức</h2>

<h3>Khẳng định</h3>

<p>S + am/is/are + V-ing</p>

<p>Ví dụ: She is studying now.</p>

<h3>Phủ định</h3>

<p>S + am/is/are + not + V-ing</p>

<p>Ví dụ: She isn't studying now.</p>

<h3>Nghi vấn</h3>

<p>Am/Is/Are + S + V-ing ?</p>

<p>Ví dụ: Is she studying now?</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>3. Dấu hiệu nhận biết</h2>

<ul>
<li>now</li>
<li>right now</li>
<li>at the moment</li>
<li>look!</li>
<li>listen!</li>
<li>today</li>
<li>this week</li>
<li>this month</li>
</ul>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>4. Lưu ý quan trọng</h2>

<p>
❌ She is play football.
<br>
✅ She is playing football.
</p>

<p>
❌ He are studying.
<br>
✅ He is studying.
</p>

<p>
❌ They is playing.
<br>
✅ They are playing.
</p>

<p>
Sau am/is/are phải dùng V-ing.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>5. Bài tập luyện tập</h2>

<form id="quiz">

<p>1. Look! It _____ now.</p>
<input type="radio" name="q1" value="A"> rains<br>
<input type="radio" name="q1" value="B"> is raining<br>
<input type="radio" name="q1" value="C"> rain<br>
<input type="radio" name="q1" value="D"> rained<br>

<hr>

<p>2. They _____ football at the moment.</p>
<input type="radio" name="q2" value="A"> play<br>
<input type="radio" name="q2" value="B"> played<br>
<input type="radio" name="q2" value="C"> are playing<br>
<input type="radio" name="q2" value="D"> plays<br>

<hr>

<p>3. She _____ dinner now.</p>
<input type="radio" name="q3" value="A"> cooks<br>
<input type="radio" name="q3" value="B"> is cooking<br>
<input type="radio" name="q3" value="C"> cooked<br>
<input type="radio" name="q3" value="D"> cook<br>

<hr>

<p>4. Listen! The baby _____.</p>
<input type="radio" name="q4" value="A"> cries<br>
<input type="radio" name="q4" value="B"> cried<br>
<input type="radio" name="q4" value="C"> is crying<br>
<input type="radio" name="q4" value="D"> cry<br>

<hr>

<p>5. We _____ English right now.</p>
<input type="radio" name="q5" value="A"> study<br>
<input type="radio" name="q5" value="B"> studied<br>
<input type="radio" name="q5" value="C"> are studying<br>
<input type="radio" name="q5" value="D"> studies<br>

<br><br>

<button type="button" onclick="checkQuiz()">
Kiểm Tra Kết Quả
</button>

</form>

<div id="result" class="result"></div>

</div>

<script>

function checkQuiz(){

let score = 0;

const answers = {
q1:"B",
q2:"C",
q3:"B",
q4:"C",
q5:"C"
};

for(let key in answers){

let selected =
document.querySelector(
`input[name="${key}"]:checked`
);

if(selected &&
selected.value === answers[key]){
score++;
}

}

document.getElementById("result").innerHTML =
"🎉 Bạn đúng " + score + "/5 câu";

}

</script>

</body>
</html>
